Developed-by: Piotr Oniszczuk <piotr.oniszczuk@gmail.com>
Signed-off-by: Piotr Oniszczuk <piotr.oniszczuk@gmail.com>



diff --speed-large-files --no-dereference --minimal -Naur linux-7.3-rc3/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/Makefile linux-7.3-rc3/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/Makefile
